Hi Manuela,

Check code below:

library(dartR)
library(hierfstat)
t1 <- gl.filter.callrate(platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>,threshold = 1)
t2 <- seppop(t1)
t3 <- lapply(t2,as.matrix)
res <- lapply(t3, beta.dosage,inb=TRUE,Mb=FALSE,MATCHING=FALSE)

Cheers,
Luis

